n: baseline;">IMPURITIES CAN BE SOLID (ASH,METAL PARTICLE ETC) OR  LIQUID (CHEMICALS &amp; WATER)</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><strong>2. WHAT IS THE PRINCIPLE ON WHICH PURIFIER WORKS?</strong></span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Comic Sans MS&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">•      </span><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">WHEN BOWL/TANK IS ROTATED, CENTRIFUGAL FORCE WILL THROW ANY PARTICLE WITH DENSITY GREATER THAN THE OIL TO THE PERIPHERY OF BOWL.</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Comic Sans MS&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">•      </span><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">FORCE OF SEPARATION CAN BE GIVEN BY THE STOKE’S FORMULA  I.E.,</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Comic Sans MS&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">•      </span><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">F = Π/6 X D3 ( ρw – ρo )  w2  r ------------(2)</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">    <span class=" Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span>WHERE D = DIAMETER OF IMPURITY PARTICLE/OIL GLOBULE</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">    <span class=" Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span> ( ρw – ρo ) = DENSITY DIFFERENCE BETWEEN WATER &amp; OIL.</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">    <span class=" Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span> W = ANGULAR VELOCITY OF THE DISC.</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> R = EFFECTIVE RADIUS/ DISTANCE OF IMPURITY PARTICLE FROM BOWL CENTRE. FOR THIS DIAMETER OF BOWL TO BE INCREASED. BUT THERE IS LIMITATION BECAUSE OF BALANCING PROBLEM.</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><strong>3. WHAT IS INTERFACE?</strong></span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Comic Sans MS&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">•      </span><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">WHEN SEPARATION STARTS BY CENTRIFUGAL FORCE, IT FORMS THREE ZONES I.E.              <span class=" Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">1. HEAVIER LIQUID/PARTICLE PHASE NEAR PERIPHERY OF BOWL                           <span class=" Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">2. LIGHT LIQUID/CLEAN OIL PHASE NEAR CENTER OF THE BOWL. &amp;                      <span class=" Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">3. MIDDLE NEUTRAL PHASE .THIS GRADUALLY BECOMES LESS &amp; EVENTUALLY FORMS THIN DIVIDING LINE BETWEEN THE TWO ZONES .THIS DIVIDING LAYER IS CALLED INTERFACE OR E-LINE.</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Comic Sans MS&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">•      </span><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">THE POSITION OF INTERFACE DECIDES THE DEGREE OF PURIFICATION</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Comic Sans MS&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">•      </span><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">THE OPTIMUM POSITION OF INTERFACE IS BETWEEN EDGE OF DISC STACK &amp; THE OUT SIDE EDGE OF THE TOP DISC.</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; text-indent: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Comic Sans MS&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">•      </span><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">POSITION OF INTERFACE CAN BE FIXED BY USING CORRECT SIZE OF GRAVITY DISC.</span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;">                    <span class=" Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: transparent; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; border-top: none; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0;"><span style="color: #000000; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" class="CDt4Ke zfr3Q" style="background-color: trans